      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd absolutely adore having a cube collider shape for contacts. If you are working with something non spherical you have no choice but to put the collider in an odd spot and if you aren't going over top of it you'll have to have missing spots that won't trigger.\nI set up a button on my avatar that can be clicked to trigger an effect but had to have an oddly placed sphere to get it to cover a good amount of the button's surface area. Only to have a floating large sphere underneath the button that would also trigger as if clicked.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-05-02T14:38:15.524Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would like to request the addition of a scalable cube as a contact sender and receiver. This  would allow for precision animations (example having a receiver on the ground shaped like a plane and being able to slam a sword into it, triggering an animation). In an ideal world, the cube would be scalable on the X,Y and Z axis to allow for more customisation.",
